      "statement": "Jiangsu Etern (Yongding, 600105.SS) H1 2026 report: vertically integrated preform → fiber → cable, extending into MPO assemblies; after its expansion projects reach full output it will have 1,050 t/yr of preform and 36 million fiber-km/yr of fiber. The company says preform expansion takes 18–24 months with long equipment lead times, so short-term supply stays tight even as a new capacity cycle has started; H1 2026 saw tight supply with rising volume and price, and AI-compute specialty fiber is its core growth line. Named customers are the Chinese telecom operators; no hyperscaler or overseas datacom customer is named. The company also runs overseas power engineering, auto harness and superconductor businesses. Supplier self-report; the preform is described as a product line, not stated whether it is sold outside or used captively.",
